---
// Screenshots side by side and centred, wrapping onto new lines when the column is narrow.
---

<div class="screenshot-row"><slot /></div>

<style is:global>
  .sl-markdown-content .screenshot-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  /*
   * Starlight spaces consecutive elements with a top margin, and a lone
   * screenshot centres itself with auto side margins: here the gap and
   * justify-content do both.
   */
  .sl-markdown-content .screenshot-row > .screenshot {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
